                <pb facs="0263" n="157" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg157"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Hicks to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <hi rendition="#italic"><date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1906-08-23">August 23,
                        1906</date></hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have just delivered to President $10,000, gift of people of San Francisco, Cal.,
                    for earthquake sufferers; first American subscription.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hicks.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
